<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia 2020 indexed T-bond yields 4.890 pct.</title>
<headline>Australia 2020 indexed T-bond yields 4.890 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of today's A$150 million indexed Treasury bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of</p>
<p>Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering	   Allotted	    Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  4.0 Aug 2020 AS150 million    A$149 million     4.890	 4.87-4.90</p>
<p>(RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 49)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
